    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.397,
      "end": 8.804,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "头发子嘞，利浦市公安局发龙派出所的民警就接到报警，讲有个女白领在镇里面的大江村附近就失了去了。",
      "score": 0.1484,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1394,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1167,
        "sc_delta": 0.0227,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.159,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.143,
        "phon_examples": "失/死",
        "lexicon": "嘞",
        "text_free": "出发者呢？荔浦市公安局法隆派出所的民警就接到报警，讲有个女白领在镇里面的大江村附近就死了去了。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 8.88,
      "end": 11.948,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "警方呢就马上组织了二十名搜救队伍，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0055,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0043,
        "sc_delta": 0.0012,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "警方呢，就马上组织了二十名搜救队伍。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 11.948,
      "end": 14.78,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "开展了营救。报警的陈明呢，",
      "score": 0.1847,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1481,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1812,
        "sc_delta": -0.0331,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.003,
        "seg_cer": 0.182,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.5,
        "phon_examples": "明/民",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "开展了营救。报警的村民呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 14.78,
      "end": 17.894,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "就是这个女白领老葛。根据他老葛讲啊，",
      "score": 0.4884,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.6257,
        "sc_logprob": -0.709,
        "sc_delta": -0.0833,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.719,
        "seg_cer": 0.25,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "就是这个李白的《老丐》，根据他《老丐》讲啊。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 18.11,
      "end": 21.326,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "他女呢十岁，是九号晚上五点多钟，",
      "score": 0.2018,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1929,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1937,
        "sc_delta": -0.0008,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.07,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.5,
        "phon_examples": "十/四",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "他女儿四岁，是九号晚上五点多钟。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 21.573,
      "end": 25.634,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "跟他和他老婆在村子里面卖卤蛋果的途中呢就失的。",
      "score": 0.4314,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.566,
        "sc_logprob": -0.5413,
        "sc_delta": 0.0247,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.63,
        "seg_cer": 0.227,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "跟他和他老婆在村子里面卖鹿晗锅的途中呢，走蛇的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 25.917,
      "end": 28.403,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "屋里人还在附近找了一夜都没找到，",
      "score": 0.4603,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.6067,
        "sc_logprob": -0.612,
        "sc_delta": -0.0053,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.691,
        "seg_cer": 0.133,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "屋里",
        "text_free": "五六人还在附近找了，一夜都没找到。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 28.403,
      "end": 38.109,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "所以呢就报警求助。为了尽快的找到女白领，派出所的民警和利浦市刑侦大队的民警共二十个人组成了三次搜救队伍，",
      "score": 0.0653,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1461,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1481,
        "sc_delta": -0.002,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "所以呢，就报警求助。为了尽快地找到吕柏，派出所的民警和黎布市刑侦大队的民警共二十个人组成了三支搜救队伍。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 38.109,
      "end": 43.762,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "带到警犬、无人机，采用警犬追踪、搜索与无人机结合的战术，",
      "score": 0.0381,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
