    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 79.787,
      "end": 83.49,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "终于在这个山窝窝的底下发现了女白领的身影。",
      "score": 0.3191,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2805,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2856,
        "sc_delta": -0.0051,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.202,
        "seg_cer": 0.25,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 1.0,
        "phon_examples": "影/音 身/声 女/驴",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "终于啊，在这个山窝窝的底下，发现了驴白的声音。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 83.882,
      "end": 87.323,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这个时候，女白领全身湿透了，衣服啊全部是泥巴，",
      "score": 0.0914,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0574,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0592,
        "sc_delta": -0.0018,
